    "causal_summary": "cli-classifier is the single public skill identity for classifier models that return typed judgments, a hub with two transport packets. The hub routes a judgment request through mode-registry.json and hub-router.json to mode cli-jev, which runs over the cli-usage packet and bridges the hosted jev CLI and MCP surface, or to mode cli-deem, one Node file that checks the local Deem server with health and asks it for a value. Either transport returns a probability, one option key, an ordered level position or a batch of keyed answers, and the two never fail over to each other silently. Write, Edit and Task are forbidden and mutatesWorkspace is false, so a transport selects while a workflow acts. The advisor sees one hub and resolves the transport by hub membership, because every transport is routingClass metadata.",
